- turn_dispatch.rs: the relay-refusal abandon before queue promotion (relay authority lost during the off-lock Engram evaluation), the Human-source abandon, and the host-shutdown abandon;
- engram_retry_schedule.rs: a begin-preparation budget dropped for naming another head;
- session_lifecycle.rs: the expedited source-observation gate retry_at;
- engram_source_sightings.rs: finish_source_observation_handoff_locked taking the gate when the head has no engram intent;
- human_prompts.rs: the start-failure rollback after a runtime reset dropped carried checks.
Source: the stamp audit, whose evidence note lists these as reading-backed.
